  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Orange Corners: Upper Egypt &#x2013; Hackathon in Cairo 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will contribute to an improved ecosystem for entrepreneurs in Egypt, through the organisation of a Hackathon where students, entrepreneurs and public sector come together.The participants will have a fun half-day event in which they gain experience in challenge-based learning and have the opportunity to use and develop entrepreneurial thinking, as they will be working on a challenge in the field of CWSA, Waste or Food.The problem owners will get ideas on how to tackle their problem.</narrative>
  </description>
